ed_at":"2026-06-29T02:09:03Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Version 4.7 Stable (Steam)\n\n\n### System information\n\nArch Linux 7.0.9 CachyOS - RTX4060 Nvidia Driver Closed Source\n\n### Issue description\n\nI made a rally car using 6DofGenericJoint for the suspensions and RigidBody3D for the wheels. The car works well overall, but I’ve run into one issue:\n\n    The car speed seems capped at around 22.0–22.5.\n\n    All the wheels are limited to about 46–47 angular velocity.\n\n    Increasing the torque on the wheels does not help — they remain locked at that angular velocity.\n\nIf I apply a central force directly to the car body, I can bypass the 22 speed limit, but the wheels are still capped at 46–47 angular velocity.\n\nI’m not sure if this is a mistake on my side, a known limitation of the physics engine, or if it’s working as intended. My goal is to accelerate the car only by applying torque to the wheels, but right now the wheels won’t spin faster than that limit.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nopen the project and play the scene, drive the car with arrow keys and watch the reported wheels angular velocity.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[rally-car_jolt.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29445482/rally-car_jolt.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"almoandrioli-ai","id":260156588,"node_id":"U_kgDOD4GsrA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260156588?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/almoandrioli-ai","html_url":"https://github.com/almoandrioli-ai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almoandrioli-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almoandrioli-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almoandrioli-ai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almoandrioli-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almoandrioli-ai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almoandrioli-ai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almoandrioli-ai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almoandrioli-ai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/almoandrioli-ai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120724/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120724/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}